WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.402
-We don't always
have enough time

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.471
to cover all of the recent news,
so here with a recap

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:05.972
is one of our writers,
Amber Ruffin,

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:08.841
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What."

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:10.910
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.947
-You guys!
Things have been crazy!

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:17.316
Okay, first of all,
everyone was like,

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:18.317
"Look at this cow."

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:19.619
And I was like, "What?"

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:24.224
But then I saw the whole picture
and was like, "Whaaaat?!"

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:27.760
What does that cow eat?
Other cows?

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:31.330
Then, on Twitter, Trump referred
to himself as "President T."

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.366
And I was like, "What?"

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.568
The only way we'll have
a President T

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:39.873
is if this guy runs in 2020.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:42.508
Trump also said that
people told him

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:45.878
he's like Elvis,
and I was like, "What?!"

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:47.746
The only way you're like Elvis

00:00:47.746 --> 00:00:51.484
is that you
will likely die on a toilet.

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:58.157
But not for 100 years,
because it never ends with you.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:00.793
Then something
hilarious happened.

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:04.029
Okay, a super far-right woman
named Laura Loomer

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:06.866
got banned from Twitter
and then handcuffed herself

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.068
to Twitter headquarters
to protest.

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:11.371
And I was like, "What?

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:13.739
She's going to get in
so much trouble."

00:01:13.739 --> 00:01:15.875
But then Twitter was like,
"Who cares?"

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.210
Police came, cut her free,

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.011
and Twitter didn't even
press charges.

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:21.380
I was like, "What?!"

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:23.450
Girl, you handcuffed yourself

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.218
to the thing you hate
for no reason.

00:01:26.218 --> 00:01:27.520
Also, look at this.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:30.123
She only handcuffed herself
to one door.

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:32.191
You're supposed to chain
yourself to both doors

00:01:32.191 --> 00:01:33.359
so they can't open them.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:36.262
Otherwise,
you're just a doorman.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:47.340
Then the national dog show
happened, and it was beautiful.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:50.443
It was fluffy little "what"
after fluffy little "what"

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.011
after fluffy little "what."

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:57.217
Oh, it was great until one of
handlers ate his dog's treat.

00:01:57.217 --> 00:01:58.550
Look.

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:03.923
-Standard wants you to take
a good look this breed.

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:08.861
-[ Laughs ]
I was like, "What?!"

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:12.731
That doggy worked hard
for that treat, and you ate it.

00:02:12.731 --> 00:02:15.168
That doggy stood still
while a stranger

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:18.904
touched his little doggy balls
and judged them.

00:02:18.904 --> 00:02:20.473
He deserves a treat.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:25.010
You ate dog food as a grown man
on national television.

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:29.215
Instead of how I did --
as a child, on a dare.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.950
Then the Crown Prince
of Saudi Arabia

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:34.853
had a journalist murdered,
and then he thought

00:02:34.853 --> 00:02:37.823
he could just show up to
the G20 Summit this week

00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:39.425
and be friends with everybody.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.527
But when it came time
for handshakes,

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:44.831
all the other world leaders
were like, "Nope.

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:50.035
No. Nope. No. No."

00:02:50.035 --> 00:02:52.872
Yeah, it's hard being
a murderer.

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:55.975
Then a woman got mad at
Southwest Airlines

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.945
because the ticket agent made
fun of her child's name.

00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:04.918
Her child's name, Abcde,
spelled A-B-C-D-E.

00:03:04.918 --> 00:03:07.820
And I was like, "W-H-A-T?!"

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:11.223
This poor child. Abcde.

00:03:11.223 --> 00:03:13.960
Of course your child
got made fun of at Southwest.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:18.097
You named her after
their boarding zones.

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:21.000
You know what kind of pain
this child will have?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.737
I do because my middle name
is Mildred.

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:27.473
A-B-C-D-E-F that.

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:30.877
Then Ivanka Trump
was asked recently about how

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:33.112
she used her
personal e-mail account

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:35.548
to send official
White House e-mails.

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:37.716
But I did not hear her answer

00:03:37.716 --> 00:03:41.354
because I was like,
"What is this lighting?"

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:44.657
Is this an interview
or is she in an old Disney movie

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:47.759
with flying, talking
magic birds?

00:03:47.759 --> 00:03:50.096
She is literally glowing.

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:52.165
But, you know, I can't relate.

00:03:52.165 --> 00:03:54.433
I don't need special effects
to look good.

00:03:54.433 --> 00:03:58.972
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:58.972 --> 00:04:04.276
All I need is
five professional adults.

00:04:04.276 --> 00:04:05.711
They're so tired.

00:04:05.711 --> 00:04:07.213
Oh, you know what?

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:08.380
I think I get it.

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.783
Is it that you think
soft lighting

00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:13.553
makes unpleasant things
easier to hear?

00:04:13.553 --> 00:04:15.688
Hmm. Let me try.

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:18.591
Ivanka, I believe you
to be complicit

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:21.127
in the destruction
of our nation.

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:24.497
-And your dad is a dick.
-That's right, birdie.

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:26.566
-This has been
"Amber Says What."

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:29.569
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

